{"articleNo":"426788","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=426788&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 2023년 제42회 스승의 날 유공 교원 장관표창 추천 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.03.13","hit":"4623","attachments":[{"name":"[붙임] 장관표창에 대한 교육주체 추천서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=426788&attachNo=122029"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">년 제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">42</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">회 스승의 날 유공 교원 장관표창 추천을 다음과 같이 안내드리오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">본교의 모범 교원이 선정될 수 있도록 많은 추천바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">공 고 일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2023. 3. 13.(</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) ~ 3. 16.(</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">) 18</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">시까지</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-hansi-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;\">공고일 마감 후에는 추천서 받지 않음</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">추천권자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">본교 소속 학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">학부모</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">단체</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">등 교육주체</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">대 상 자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">본교에 재직하고 있는 현직 교원</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">추천분야</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">:</span></p><p class=\"0\"></p><table style=\"border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:52.77pt;height:18.47pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.25pt;border-left:solid #000000 0.25pt;border-bottom:double #000000 2.55pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.25pt;background:#d8d8d8;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;\">분 야</span></p></td><td style=\"width:429.16pt;height:18.47pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.25pt;border-left:solid #000000 0.25pt;border-bottom:double #000000 2.55pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.25pt;background:#d8d8d8;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;\">내 용</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:52.77pt;height:44.47pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:double #000000 2.55pt;border-left:solid #000000 0.25pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.25pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.25pt;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;\">학술진흥</span></p></td><td style=\"width:429.16pt;height:44.47pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:double #000000 2.55pt;border-left:solid #000000 0.25pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.25pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.25pt;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;mso-hansi-font-family:맑은;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">◆</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;font-family:맑은;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;\">다년간 연구에 몰입하여 신기술 개발</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;font-family:맑은;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;\">신생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;font-family:맑은;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;\">소외 분야 등의 연구에 매진하여 학문적 기틀 마련에 공적이 뛰어난 자</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;mso-hansi-font-family:맑은;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">◆</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;font-family:맑은;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;\">세계학술지에 우수 논문 게재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;font-family:맑은;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;\">전공분야에 학문적 성과 등으로 학술진흥에 공적이 뛰어난 자</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width:52.77pt;height:44.47pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.25pt;border-left:solid #000000 0.25pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.25pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.25pt;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;\">인재양성</span></p></td><td style=\"width:429.16pt;height:44.47pt;padding:1.41pt 5.10pt 1.41pt 5.10pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.25pt;border-left:solid #000000 0.25pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.25pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.25pt;\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;mso-hansi-font-family:맑은;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">◆</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;font-family:맑은;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;\">전공분야의 후학양성을 위해 노력하여 청출어람의 본보기가 되는 자</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;mso-hansi-font-family:맑은;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">◆</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;font-family:맑은;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;\">학문적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;font-family:맑은;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;\">기술적 노하우 전수를 통하여 우수인재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;font-family:맑은;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:맑은;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은;\">기술인력 양성에 공적이 뛰어난 자</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">5.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">추천방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: [</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">]</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.1pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.1pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">장관표창에 대한 교육주체 추천서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.1pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">’&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;letter-spacing:-0.1pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">작성 후 이메일 제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.1pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(s00273@kumoh.ac.kr)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">6.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">참고사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">:</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">추천자가 많을 경우 본교 내부기준에 의하여 최종 추천 결정</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">실제 교육경력</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;5</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">년 이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">기포상자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">징계 처분을 받은 자 등 장관표창 규정&nbsp;충족 여부 등을 고려하여 최종 추천 결정</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:Noto;font-family:Noto;mso-ascii-font-family:Noto;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">붙임 장관표창에 대한 교육주체 추천서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;1</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:휴먼명조;mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:휴먼명조;font-family:휴먼명조;mso-ascii-font-family:휴먼명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"22351\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5656\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"user\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\"